\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  We go away from this table\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Those who receive the Holy power
\par With Christ we have resurrected
\par In His Love He finds us so clean
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  May love dwell always in our homes
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 That we may receive God's blessings
\par As we were thought by Christ Jesus
\par For us to emulate the same
\par 
\par \pard\fi-315\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   3.  May the Grace of God be with us
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj And make us spread your word on earth
\par Let's look up to the Lord Jesus
\par And make us learn and follow Him
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Then, Father Almighty our Lord
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj Give us the strength to journey through
\par Be graceful to us that we may
\par \pard     With joy fight on to victory. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

